 """T11: write cards/delphes_card_ALFA_{Xe2bar,C4F10}.tcl from the bundle card, replacing the ARCPID radiator block
-with the k4geo full-simulation calibration (T05, T06, T11prep, T12, bending fit in work/T11/bending_fit.json)."""
